# Versification "Bible Strong OST": an overlay on Paratext org.vrs, for the Ostervald Bible
# (OST).
#
# OST numbers the Psalms as org (LSG), titles as verses, and also Numbers 29-30, 1 Samuel 23-24,
# 1 Kings 22, Isaiah 8-9, Ezekiel 20-21, Hosea 11-12, Jonah and most of the New Testament.
# Elsewhere it numbers as the English Bibles, or in its own way.
#
# Mapping lines go from OST to org. Each was checked against the alignment of the OST text with
# the LSG text (docs/research/versification.md, section 2.4).
#
GEN 31:55 32:32
EXO 7:25 8:32 21:36 22:31
LEV 5:19 6:30
NUM 12:15 13:34 16:50 17:13 25:18
DEU 12:32 13:18 22:30 23:25 28:68 29:29
1SA 20:43 21:15
2SA 18:33 19:43
1KI 4:34 5:18
2KI 11:21 12:21
1CH 5:26 6:81 12:40
2CH 1:17 2:18 13:22 14:15
NEH 3:32 4:23 7:73 9:38 10:39
JOB 38:38 39:38 40:28 41:25
PSA 30:14
ECC 4:16 5:20 11:8 12:16
SNG 6:13 7:13
ISA 64:12
JER 8:22 9:26
DAN 3:30 4:37 5:31 6:28
HOS 1:11 2:23 13:16 14:9
JOL 2:32 3:21 4:0
MIC 4:13 5:15
NAM 1:15 2:13
ZEC 1:21 2:13
MAL 3:18 4:6
MRK 9:51 10:53
1CO 3:22
#
# As in the English Bibles (eng.vrs with the corrections of eng-fixes.vrs):
GEN 31:55 = GEN 32:1
GEN 32:1-32 = GEN 32:2-33
EXO 8:1-4 = EXO 7:26-29
EXO 8:5-32 = EXO 8:1-28
EXO 22:1 = EXO 21:37
EXO 22:2-31 = EXO 22:1-30
LEV 6:1-7 = LEV 5:20-26
LEV 6:8-30 = LEV 6:1-23
NUM 16:36-50 = NUM 17:1-15
NUM 17:1-13 = NUM 17:16-28
NUM 26:1 = NUM 25:19
NUM 26:1 = NUM 26:1
DEU 12:32 = DEU 13:1
DEU 13:1-18 = DEU 13:2-19
DEU 22:30 = DEU 23:1
DEU 23:1-25 = DEU 23:2-26
DEU 29:1 = DEU 28:69
DEU 29:2-29 = DEU 29:1-28
1SA 21:1-15 = 1SA 21:2-16
2SA 18:33 = 2SA 19:1
2SA 19:1-43 = 2SA 19:2-44
1KI 4:21-34 = 1KI 5:1-14
1KI 5:1-18 = 1KI 5:15-32
2KI 11:21 = 2KI 12:1
2KI 12:1-21 = 2KI 12:2-22
1CH 6:1-15 = 1CH 5:27-41
1CH 6:16-81 = 1CH 6:1-66
1CH 12:4 = 1CH 12:4
1CH 12:4 = 1CH 12:5
1CH 12:5-40 = 1CH 12:6-41
2CH 2:1 = 2CH 1:18
2CH 2:2-18 = 2CH 2:1-17
2CH 14:1 = 2CH 13:23
2CH 14:2-15 = 2CH 14:1-14
NEH 4:1-6 = NEH 3:33-38
NEH 4:7-23 = NEH 4:1-17
NEH 7:69-73 = NEH 7:68-72
NEH 9:38 = NEH 10:1
NEH 10:1-39 = NEH 10:2-40
ECC 5:1 = ECC 4:17
ECC 5:2-20 = ECC 5:1-19
SNG 6:13 = SNG 7:1
SNG 7:1-13 = SNG 7:2-14
ISA 64:1 = ISA 63:19
ISA 64:2-12 = ISA 64:1-11
JER 9:1 = JER 8:23
JER 9:2-26 = JER 9:1-25
DAN 4:1-3 = DAN 3:31-33
DAN 4:4-37 = DAN 4:1-34
DAN 5:31 = DAN 6:1
DAN 6:1-28 = DAN 6:2-29
HOS 1:10-11 = HOS 2:1-2
HOS 2:1-23 = HOS 2:3-25
HOS 13:16 = HOS 14:1
HOS 14:1-9 = HOS 14:2-10
JOL 2:28-32 = JOL 3:1-5
JOL 3:1-21 = JOL 4:1-21
MIC 5:1 = MIC 4:14
MIC 5:2-15 = MIC 5:1-14
NAM 1:15 = NAM 2:1
NAM 2:1-13 = NAM 2:2-14
ZEC 1:18-21 = ZEC 2:1-4
ZEC 2:1-13 = ZEC 2:5-17
MAL 4:1-6 = MAL 3:19-24
#
# Numbers 13 opens a verse earlier: OST 13:1 ("Après cela, le peuple
# partit de Hatséroth…") is org 12:16, and OST 13:2 ("L'Éternel parla à Moïse…") is org 13:1.
NUM 13:1 = NUM 12:16
NUM 13:2-34 = NUM 13:1-33
#
# 1 Samuel 20 has 43 verses: OST 20:43 ("David se leva donc et s'en alla…") is org 21:1, and
# OST 20:42 ("Va en paix…") is org 20:42 alone. 1 Samuel 21 then follows the English Bibles.
1SA 20:43 = 1SA 21:1
1SA 21:1-15 = 1SA 21:2-16
#
# Job 38-41, numbered as NEG79 and FMAR, and as the numbers Lausanne prints in brackets: OST
# 39:1 is
# org 38:39, OST 39:34 ("L'Éternel adressa la parole à Job…") is org 40:1, and OST 40:28
# ("Voici, tout espoir de le prendre est trompé…") is org 41:1.
JOB 39:1-3 = JOB 38:39-41
JOB 39:4-33 = JOB 39:1-30
JOB 39:34-38 = JOB 40:1-5
JOB 40:1-27 = JOB 40:6-32
JOB 40:28 = JOB 41:1
JOB 41:1-25 = JOB 41:2-26
#
# Psalm 30: OST cuts the last verse in two. OST 30:13 ("Afin que ma gloire chante ta louange…")
# and 30:14 ("Éternel, mon Dieu, je te célébrerai à toujours.") are org 30:13.
#! &PSA 30:13-14 = PSA 30:13
#
# Ecclesiastes 12 opens two verses earlier: OST 12:1 ("Jeune homme, réjouis-toi…") is org 11:9.
ECC 12:1-2 = ECC 11:9-10
ECC 12:3-16 = ECC 12:1-14
#
# Mark 9 has 51 verses and Mark 10 has 53: OST cuts in two the verse that ends each chapter.
# OST 9:50-51 ("C'est une bonne chose que le sel…", "Ayez du sel en vous-mêmes…") is org 9:50;
# OST 10:52-53 ("Va-t'en, ta foi t'a sauvé.", "Et incontinent il recouvra la vue…") is org 10:52.
#! &MRK 9:50-51 = MRK 9:50
#! &MRK 10:52-53 = MRK 10:52
#
# 1 Corinthians 3 has 22 verses: OST 3:22 ("Soit Paul, soit Apollos… et vous êtes à Christ, et
# Christ est à Dieu.") is org 3:22 and 3:23.
1CO 3:22 = 1CO 3:22
1CO 3:22 = 1CO 3:23
#
# Two verses hold the next one, whose number OST does not print: OST Matthew 11:2 ("…il envoya
# deux de ses disciples pour lui dire : Es-tu celui qui doit venir…") is org 11:2 and 11:3, and
# OST Romans 3:22 ("…car il n'y a point de distinction, puisque tous ont péché…") is org 3:22
# and 3:23.
MAT 11:2 = MAT 11:2
MAT 11:2 = MAT 11:3
ROM 3:22 = ROM 3:22
ROM 3:22 = ROM 3:23
